TI  - Co-cultivation of the strictly anaerobic methanogen Methanosarcina barkeri with aerobic methanotrophs in an oxygen-limited membrane bioreactor.
AU  - In 't Zandt, Michiel H
AU  - van den Bosch, Tijs J M
